Anime Painting

[l_english.MODULE_PAINTING_ANIME_desc]
When your enemy sneaks up to your tank at night, but can’t resist either swearing or jumping up to lick the tank armor, you’ll understand why it’s reconnaissance that has been improved.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PAINTING_ANIME]
二次元涂装

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PAINTING_ANIME_desc]
当你的敌军在夜晚偷偷摸摸潜行到你的坦克前，却没有忍住爆粗口或者扑上来舔坦克装甲的时候，你就明白为什么是侦查提升了。
